<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Sydney Casino reports 18 mth net loss.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Sydney Casino reports 18 mth net loss.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eighteen months to December 31</p>
<p>		   (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net			     loss   4.82 vs loss 52.30</p>
<p>    Operating		   profit 101.62 vs loss 16.37</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	     loss  105.92 vs loss 51.18</p>
<p>NOTE: Sydney Harbour Casino ltd is a casino operator. The latest figures compare with the 12 months to June 30, 1995 as the company has moved to a calendar year balance date.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  495.17 vs 0.002</p>
<p>    Other income			   2.74 vs 2.60</p>
<p>    Tax			     charge 0.52 vs credit 15.25</p>
<p>    Interest				 8.44 vs 0.35</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  22.72 vs 0.85</p>
<p>NOTE: U.S. casino operator Showboat Inc was the largest shareholder in the Sydney casino operator with a 26.3 percent stake until Kerry Packer's Publishing and Broadcasting Ltd said in mid-January that it would buy a 10 percent in the casino from Showboat.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
